==English==
===Etymology===
The meaning "spell of nervousness," recorded since 1896, stems perhaps from the [[woollies]], a dialectal term for "nervous uneasiness," probably in reference to the physical [[itchiness]] of wool garments.
 LLLLLLLL

'''willies'''

# {{plural of|[[willy]]}}
